# shellcheck settings for review/ci-red/ (this file replaces the repository's .shellcheckrc for this directory).
#   SC2001  recount.sh escapes the parentheses of a test name with `sed 's/[()]/\\&/g'`; a parameter expansion would
#           do the same. The script is kept byte-identical to the one whose output is quoted (README.md), so the
#           style note is disabled here instead of editing it.
# The repository-wide exceptions, kept so a script added here later is checked the same way:
disable=SC2001,SC2086,SC2015,SC2016,SC2012,SC2317,SC2034
